error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::server_only(...)` cannot capture reactive signal `count`

       Why:
         Server-only slots emit static SSR content. Client hydration does not re-run that subtree, so a signal read there would never update.

       Use one of:
         - Move the signal read into a normal rsjs reactive slot outside `rsjs::server_only(...)`.
         - If the value is intentionally static, pass plain server data into the server-only child.

       Tracked feature:
         server_boundary.server_only_signal_capture
